WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:04.334
Unit fifteen. Volume and Brightness!

2
00:00:05.286 --> 00:00:10.030
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:13.134
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.184 --> 00:00:17.349
Today we learn about Volume and Brightness. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.948 --> 00:00:22.941
Volume. Say it with me. Volume!

6
00:00:26.488 --> 00:00:30.783
Brightness. Say it with me. Brightness!

7
00:00:34.262 --> 00:00:37.829
Loud. Say it with me. Loud!

8
00:00:41.332 --> 00:00:45.032
Quiet. Say it with me. Quiet!

9
00:00:48.533 --> 00:00:52.062
Bright. Say it with me. Bright!

10
00:00:55.559 --> 00:00:59.059
Dim. Say it with me. Dim!

11
00:01:02.557 --> 00:01:06.591
Adjust. Say it with me. Adjust!

12
00:01:10.061 --> 00:01:14.345
Screen. Say it with me. Screen!

13
00:01:17.853 --> 00:01:25.724
I can adjust the volume to make sound louder or quieter. I can adjust the brightness to make the screen brighter or dimmer.

14
00:01:25.774 --> 00:01:28.887
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:29.606 --> 00:01:35.227
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:35.277 --> 00:01:36.427
Loud!

17
00:01:37.425 --> 00:01:42.964
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:43.014 --> 00:01:44.164
Adjust!

19
00:01:45.317 --> 00:01:52.625
Did you know? Lowering your screen brightness at night can also help save your device's battery!

20
00:01:52.675 --> 00:01:55.151
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:55.968 --> 00:02:04.382
Think and answer. When might you want to make the screen dimmer?

22
00:02:04.432 --> 00:02:05.582
Great answer!

23
00:02:06.418 --> 00:02:12.188
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:12.238 --> 00:02:15.340
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

